menu "Power Supply Configuration"

config POWER_SUPPLY_EMERGENCY_STOP_SEND_PERIOD_MSEC
    int "Emergency stop periodic send period in milliseconds"
    default 100
    help
      Period in milliseconds for periodically sending the emergency stop
      status message over CAN when the emergency stop is engaged.

config POWER_SUPPLY_RAILS_MEASURES_PERIOD_MSEC
    int "Power rails measures period in milliseconds"
    default 1000
    help
      Period in milliseconds for sampling the voltage and current of the
      power rails and sending the measures over CAN.

endmenu
